  "title": "Chicken Vindaloo",
  "description": "This chicken vindaloo is an Indian potato and meat dish flavored with toasted spices like coriander, cloves, cumin, cinnamon, cardamom, and turmeric.",
  "authors": [
    "Keith Dallmer"
  ],
